<meta name="description" content="The Tennessee Department of Environment and Conservation (TDEC) Division of Land Protection, Materials Management Program, is accepting grant applications from municipalities, counties, and other eligible entities across the state. The program helps local governments divert more waste from landfills, upgrade infrastructure, and give residents convenient ways to participate in recycling." />
